{"id":"statsgrid","code":"<style>.stg{width:340px;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;padding:16px 6px;text-align:center}\n.stg .k{color:var(--body,#B6BDC8);font:600 10px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.06em}\n.stg h4{margin:8px 0 16px;color:var(--ink,#fff);font:700 20px Inter,sans-serif}\n.stg .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:1px;background:var(--line,#262C34);border:1px solid var(--line,#262C34);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}\n.stg .cell{background:var(--card,#171B22);padding:16px 10px}\n.stg .cell b{display:block;color:var(--accent,#3366FF);font:700 24px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace}\n.stg .cell span{color:var(--body,#B6BDC8);font:400 10px Inter,sans-serif}</style>\n<div class=\"stg\"><div class=\"k\">STATISTICS</div><h4>Our SaaS by the numbers</h4><div class=\"grid\"><div class=\"cell\"><b>50K</b><span>Active Users</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><b>$1.2M</b><span>Revenue 2023</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><b>1.5M</b><span>API Requests</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><b>45</b><span>Countries</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><b>99.9%</b><span>Uptime</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><b>24/7</b><span>Support</span></div></div></div>"}